# Global rules — portfolio

- Ship accessible UI: semantic headings, visible focus for keyboard users, sufficient contrast with the warm palette.
- No autoplay for media; no sound without explicit user action.
- Prefer plain language; avoid sensational copy.
- External links: `target="_blank"` with `rel="noopener noreferrer"`.
- When adding animation, check `prefers-reduced-motion` and provide a non-animated equivalent.
- Keep diffs focused; do not reintroduce removed “disco” patterns (particles, binary rain, music player, etc.) without an explicit product request.
